  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in US–Iran military escalation diverts strategic air- and sealift, prepositioned stocks, and maintenance/repair capacity toward the Middle East and force-protection tasks, reducing the available logistics throughput and resupply rotations that sustain operations in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
