  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A tangible shortfall in crude availability produces fuel rationing and sharply higher transport and input costs in affected markets, directly depressing industrial output, trade and commercial activity in Ukraine and adjacent economies that support the war economy.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confront</data>
