  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained elevations in global oil prices raise export revenues for major producers (including Russia), enabling greater defense procurement and domestic arms production capacity that increases the rate of materiel deliveries into the Russia–Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confront</data>
