  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in crude prices increases export revenue for Russia on short notice, enabling procurement/production of fuel and munitions and financing higher operational tempo, which raises the frequency and intensity of cross‑border strikes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">opec_energy_volatility</data>
