  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">If markets reprices toward higher expected Japanese policy rates, institutional investors shift allocations toward higher domestic fixed‑income returns, reducing marginal allocations to higher‑risk China/EU AI investments and fundraising rounds.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">japan_fx_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_tech_rivalry</data>
