  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A perceived tightening path for Japanese policy rates strengthens the yen and tightens global carry/short-term funding conditions, reducing commodity-financing demand and compressing crude risk premia, which lowers oil prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">japan_fx_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">opec_energy_volatility</data>
