  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden rise in market-implied Japanese policy rates triggers a global repricing of interest rates that increases borrowing and working-capital costs for European and U.S. defense contractors and exporters, causing delays or downscaling of procurement and deliveries to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
