  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid deleveraging and directional unwind by Japan‑based leveraged investors forces outsized sales of AI‑linked equities/ETFs with China/EU exposure, producing larger intraday and multi‑day swings in those AI asset prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">japan_fx_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">china_eu_tech_rivalry</data>
