  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid deleveraging and liquidation by major Japanese investor cohorts forces sales of commodity futures and oil-linked risk positions, producing immediate downward pressure on crude futures prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d39">japan_fx_bond_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">opec_energy_volatility</data>
