  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid deleveraging of Japan-focused leveraged positions forces asset managers and prime brokers to sell credit and withdraw short-term funding lines, prompting banks and trade-finance providers to tighten or cut letters of credit and shipping finance, reducing the operational capacity to move and stage materiel for the Ukrainian front.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d39">japan_fx_bond_stress</data>
